l. There is no cap on this bonus."]},{"k":"p","c":["He starts with a hidden ",{"i":"Sprite-Night_Sword.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:night-sword"}," ",{"t":"Night Sword","r":"weapon:night-sword"}," that can only retaliate without taking up any weapon slots and the weapon version can still be offered. It is upgraded every 10 levels starting at level 20, up to level 80 when it is maxed at level 8."]},{"k":"p","c":["Defeating 100,000 enemies in a single run with him will unlock ",{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Syuuto_Moonspell.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:megalo-syuuto-moonspell"}," ",{"t":"Megalo Syuuto Moonspell","r":"character:megalo-syuuto-moonspell"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-TidesOfTheFoscari.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Tides of the Foscari DLC to access"}," as a playable character."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Syuuto_Moonspell.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Syuuto Moonspell's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Syuuto_Moonspell.gif","w":94,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Syuuto_Moonspell_-_trailer.png","w":300,"h":172,"c":["Syuuto Moonspell as seen in the ",{"t":"launch trailer","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c9xLGO9ujEk"}," of Legacy of the Moonspell."]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 17 August 2023 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added switching of Syuuto's song during weapon evolution."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 15 December 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Syuuto's Summon Night, Night sword, design, transformation, and him being a hal